  "contract_plain_english": "The source extends the usual one-dimensional Riemann setup to a material interface: at initial time the state has constant left and right values on x < 0 and x > 0, and the medium itself is also discontinuous at x = 0 (printed page 5, equation (1.11); printed page 8, Section 1.4, selected extension sentence). It does not specify the state value at the interface or an explicit mathematical model for the medium there. The following discussion of waves, reflection, and transmission is a separate solution claim (printed page 8, immediately following sentence)."
